{
  "statement": "I appreciate the ongoing discussions towards integrating sustainability within the ATM system. I support the proposed modifications to RES-05 and merging of RES-03 with SAF-01, as these align with the goals of resource efficiency. However, I oppose the removal of TRU-04, as it reinforces the importance of safeguarding user funds, which is essential to maintain user trust and sustainable practices. I propose a synthesis where we can include an energy-efficient mechanism for logging transactions, thus fulfilling GRN-04 while ensuring data integrity and transparency.",
